<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00390/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一把蛋糕刀，可将刀刃接触到的无机物（蛋糕除外）变为相当于其所含同等能量的蛋糕。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██蛋糕店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">放置在SITE-CN-81生活垃圾处理站中</span>已丢失，正在寻找<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">访问监控录像20██/█/██，██：██</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">权限接受</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dr.Drew:我快饿死了，老子的工资都让他们收走了！<br />
Dr.Drew：现在我要试试这把刀了，我搞到了一块铀-235，这就是我下半个月的口粮<br />
[数据损坏]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>附录：</strong>Dr.Drew在极度饥饿的情况下搞到了一块铀-235（事后发现其被替换为一块SCP-████），在刀刃接触的一刹那，其被替换为超过████立方米的蛋糕，而刀被留在了蛋糕中心，Dr.Drew又一次大难不死，造成的直接经济损失████元将由Dr.Drew承担。
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00390" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00390" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00390-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608579936" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1599871998 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Sep 2020 00:53</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00315/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一根印有“MARK”字样的中性笔，在书写其他字迹时没有表现出异常，如果写到关于违背内心的话语<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">比如“我爱学习”</span>时，笔尖与纸张的接触面积将急剧减小，产生很大的压强将纸<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">与桌子一起</span>划破。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>201█/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>太█市█泽中学3█班4█6宿舍H柜内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██标准低价值异常物品收容柜<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“<em>嗯，用来当作切纸刀不错——助理研究员██”</em><br />
<em>“皮诺曹中性笔？”——研究员██</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00315" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00315" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00315-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lx-forever" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6599059); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6599059&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608579936" alt="LX-forever" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6599059)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lx-forever" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6599059); return false;">LX-forever</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1594712495 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 Jul 2020 07:41</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00400/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一颗无论用什么方式都无法让其进入篮筐的篮球。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-01与Site-CN-02友谊篮球赛赛场。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>在比赛时一名队员尝试球不离开手强行塞入篮筐<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-199792-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-199792-1')">1</a></sup>时爆炸。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这个球是Site-CN-01与Site-CN-02友谊篮球赛时Site-CN-01在领先时Site-CN-01要求换的球。要不是这个知道这个消息，我都怀疑人生了。</em>——Site-CN-02尝试扣篮的球员</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00400" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00400" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00400-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tian-xiu233" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6240575); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6240575&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608579936" alt="tian xiu233" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6240575)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tian-xiu233" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6240575); return false;">tian xiu233</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600595491 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 09:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">脚注</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-199792-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-199792-1')">1</a>. 又名扣篮。</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张████餐馆的菜单，任何人类在观察项目时，项目上的菜品都会变成此人最喜欢吃的东西，当有人在菜品后的方框中打勾时，此人的面前就会出现刚刚勾选的菜品<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市████餐馆中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于site—██的食堂中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>嘿，终于不用忍受食堂那可怕的饭菜了！</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+实验记录</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;实验记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>当使用机器人在菜单上勾选时，会在空中出现一行字：“机器人不用吃饭”语言随观察者而变化</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00111" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00111-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608579936" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587805117 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 08:58</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00118/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>項目描述：</strong>一頭荷魯斯泰因（Holstein）品種奶牛，無法正常擠奶；每次打嗝時會從口中產生凝結後為一公升的牛奶氣體。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/9/17<br />
<strong>回收地點：</strong>中國內蒙古[已編輯]牧場<br />
<strong>當前狀態：</strong>由威爾遜野生動物中國分區管理中</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00118" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00118" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00118-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2941964); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608579936" alt="M Element" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2941964); return false;">M Element</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587909108 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Apr 2020 13:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00126/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>十（10）个有自我意识的██高小人，实验表明项目的智力约等于一名高中学历的成年人。项目会在自身附近寻找██高积木，并会试图使用这些积木制造一些东西，比如：房屋，车辆等。且项目制造的交通工具可以以未知方式驱动。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> 上海市中一██高积木专卖店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于一标准人形收容间<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我认为应该对这类高智力异常进行重视</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目建造的房屋每30小时会以未知方式产生一名新的项目个体。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目个体数量已到达100个</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室内形成了一个社会群体，并且群体规模还在增大</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>经过观察，发现项目个体在超过200个时，每三天会有一名个体“死亡”，其余的个体会将同伴的“尸体”放入房屋中，30分钟后，房屋中的“尸体”会以未知方式随机转化为3个积木块。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-关闭记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室中建造了一座城市，其外观与██市完全一致</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00126" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00126" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00126-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608579936" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588077877 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 12:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
